<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank sets stock rights offer.</title>
<headline>Metrobank sets stock rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust Company said on Monday it has set a rights offer of one share for every 30.88 shares owned.</p>
<p>In a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange, Metrobank said the price had been set at 670 pesos a share. The rights offer involves 5.882 million shares.</p>
<p>The offer period and record date are yet to be finalised, the bank said. Payment will be in full upon subscription.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
